{# procmine_model.rs.tera — renders src/procmine/model.rs (single file, no fanout).
   results contains one row per chain (ordered by chainName), each with:
     chainName  — the chain's snake_case name
     golden     — the chain's ch:golden hex digest (e.g. 0xfeeba62f449f2718)
